first of all, what is monkeypox? Monkeypox&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:23.200
is an infectious disease, a communicable disease&nbsp;
that can be transmitted between animals and people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:32.080
and also between people is caused by the monkeypox&nbsp;
virus. The symptoms are initially fever, headache,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:38.800
muscle pain, swollen lymph nodes and feeling&nbsp;
tired. And then later you get this rash that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:46.400
forms blisters, which crust over. And in that&nbsp;
sense, it's in the kind of universe of smallpox,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:52.880
